-22T19:01:36Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T19:05:07Z","body":"Previously, even if the call to `rcedit.exe` failed, it would only output garbled text in the editor's console (as shown in the screenshot) without causing the editor to freeze completely. It appears that a PR has disrupted this behavior.  \n~~To reproduce this bug, set an incorrect path for `rcedit` in the Linux editor configuration (the file must exist) without specifying the `wine` path, then attempt to export the project to Windows. This will trigger the issue.~~\nI gave it a try, and it doesn't always freeze the editor 100% of the time, because when I tried again, the editor wasn't affected...\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822218417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2823828861","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105569#issuecomment-2823828861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105569","id":2823828861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oUDV9","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/us